Build the AIR (Metal) programs against panfrost, for the Exynos 990 phone's Mali-G77.

air-ir3.patch and air-metal.patch declare air_run, libredwoodair and air_metal_test in
freedreno's directory, which a DRIVERS=softpipe,panfrost build never reads. These are the
same three, here, where driver_panfrost exists: the screen they open is chosen in their
sources by GALLIUM_PANFROST (tools/mesa/air/air_metal.c, air_run.c). The libdrm stand-in
(src/redwood-drm) is compiled into each, as tools/mesa/panfrost-darwin.patch does for
libOSMesa, because freedreno's drm layer, which carries it otherwise, is not built.

--- a/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build
@@ -84,3 +84,50 @@
   compile_args : compile_args_panfrost,
   link_with : [libpanfrost, libpanfrostwinsys, libpanfrost_shared, libpanfrost_midgard, libpanfrost_bifrost, libpanfrost_decode, libpanfrost_lib],
 )
+
+# The AIR frontend's consumers, on the Mali (Darwin on redwood): see air-ir3.patch and
+# air-metal.patch for what each is; only the driver differs.
+air_panfrost_drm = []
+if host_machine.system() == 'darwin' and not with_gallium_freedreno
+  air_panfrost_drm = files('../../../redwood-drm/redwood_drm.c')
+endif
+air_panfrost_includes = [inc_include, inc_src, inc_mapi, inc_mesa, inc_gallium,
+                         inc_gallium_aux, inc_gallium_winsys_sw, inc_gallium_winsys,
+                         include_directories('../../drivers')]
+air_panfrost_deps = [dep_m, idep_air, idep_mesautil, idep_xmlconfig, driver_softpipe,
+                     driver_panfrost, dep_libdrm]
+
+air_run = executable(
+  'air_run',
+  [files('../../../compiler/air/air_run.c'), air_panfrost_drm],
+  include_directories : air_panfrost_includes,
+  dependencies : air_panfrost_deps,
+  link_with : [libgallium, libgalliumvl_stub, libws_null],
+  build_by_default : false,
+  install : false,
+)
+
+redwoodair_link_args = []
+if host_machine.system() == 'darwin'
+  redwoodair_link_args += '-Wl,-install_name,/redwood/lib/libredwoodair.dylib'
+endif
+
+libredwoodair = shared_library(
+  'redwoodair',
+  [files('../../../compiler/air/air_metal.c'), air_panfrost_drm],
+  include_directories : air_panfrost_includes,
+  dependencies : air_panfrost_deps,
+  link_with : [libgallium, libgalliumvl_stub, libws_null],
+  link_args : redwoodair_link_args,
+  build_by_default : false,
+  install : false,
+)
+
+air_metal_test = executable(
+  'air_metal_test',
+  files('../../../compiler/air/air_metal_test.c'),
+  include_directories : include_directories('../../../compiler/air'),
+  link_with : [libredwoodair],
+  build_by_default : false,
+  install : false,
+)
